# Reduce Docker build context
.git
.gitignore
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/dist
**/build
**/bin
**/*.log
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/coverage
**/__pycache__
**/.pytest_cache
**/*.pyc
.cursor
*.md
# Extension Makefile.core installs README.md into PG doc dir; must be in build context.
!README.md
!NeuronDB/**/*.md
!docker/**/*.md
